          ],
          "content": "|  A | 0° | 30° | 45° | 60° | 90° |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| sin A cos A tan A cosec A sec A cot A | 010Not defined1Not defined | 1232132233 | 12121221 | 3212323213 | 10Not defined1Not defined0 |",
